SUMMARY:Original Music Sunday w/ Larry Bitensky
DESCRIPTION:Larry blends folk-rock\, blues\, jazz\, pop\, and New Orleans piano vibes into a storytelling style full of humor\, heart\, and soul. A longtime musician\, composer\, and performer\, he recently relocated to Asheville and has quickly become part of the local music scene.\nCome hang out\, grab a drink\, relax with the pups\, and support original live music in a laid-back community atmosphere.
